  "description": "When college student Hae-Ra Kang agrees to carry out her professor’s errand, she has no idea that her professor is actually a centuries-old deity. And the errand in question? Hae-Ra must choose between a shapeshifting fox and snake, deciding which one of them will receive the amulet in her possession to become a god.\n\n(Source: WEBTOONS, edited)",
